  <h3>Extreme 4-Way Stretch & Shape Recovery</h3>
  <p>As demonstrated in the video, our custom-developed <strong>75% Nylon / 25% Spandex</strong> fabric (230-260 GSM) offers exceptional 4-way stretch. Notice how the fabric reaches maximum extension without shearing (becoming transparent) and snaps back to its original shape instantly. This high recovery rate ensures that your customers won't experience sagging knees or a loose waistband after repeated washes.</p>
  
  <h3>The 4-Needle 6-Thread Standard</h3>
  <p>The close-up shots highlight our <strong>4-Needle 6-Thread (4N6T)</strong> flatlock stitching. Unlike standard seams, this technical stitch is perfectly flat against the skin, eliminating chafing and providing maximum tensile strength. It's the hallmark of premium activewear brands and a key reason why FITCLO remains a top choice for professional yoga and gym wear private labels.</p>
  
  <h3>Squat-Proof Verification</h3>
  <p>Our fabric undergoes rigorous <strong>Quality Control</strong> tests for opacity. In the stretch detail video, you can observe the "high-density knit" structure which remains completely squat-proof even under high tension. This reliability allows brand owners to market their collections with confidence, knowing their products meet the highest performance standards.</p>

  <h3>Ready for Your Private Label</h3>
  <p>These leggings are available for <strong>low MOQ private labeling</strong>. We can apply your logo (heat transfer or silicone), add custom branded labels, and provide specialized packaging to match your brand's aesthetic. Whether you are scaling a boutique fitness brand or an established enterprise, our factory-direct solutions are designed for your success.</p>
  
